AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Recognize › File, URL, or folder
*1 Recognize     > >File, URL, or folder< Microphone 
 2 Now playing   │ Recognize music in a file, URL, or folder
 3 Streams       │ 
 4 Recognitions  │   File, URL, or folder* (e.g. song.mp3)
 5 Account       │   [ ] Add Apple Music data (link, artwork, track length)
 6 Settings      │   [ ] Add Spotify data (link, artwork, popularity)
 7 Help          │   [ ] Add Deezer data (link, artwork)
                 │   [ ] Add MusicBrainz data (IDs and release details)
                 │   [ ] Enterprise: scan more of the file (needs a limit)
                 │   Max files             (e.g. 100, or none)
                 │   Clip at               (e.g. 1:30)
                 │   [ ] Send even if cached
                 │ 
                 │   [ Recognize ]  [ Show the plan ]
                 │ 
                 │ 
                 │ 
 [ Commands ]    │ 
 [ Keys ] q quit │ 

